      "writtenOn": "2021-11-04T04:42:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The shipping module use TetheringGoogle instead of TetheringNext(override Tethering). Actually this only take effect in aosp. Both release branch and master branch use TetheringGoogle. I will have follow up CL to add TetheringGoogleNext (Override TetheringNext) and only use it in master.\n\nBTW, I don\u0027t need to have separate apex. It make thing complicated. The apex just be the container, I just need to make sure it include the right thing for each branches(dev vs release).\n\nFor aosp:\ncom.android.tethering.apex include TetheringNext\n\nFor shipped branch: com.google.android.tethering.apex include TetheringGoogle\n\nFor master branch: com.google.android.tethering.apex include TetheringGoogleNext(will have follow up change for this).",
      "parentUuid": "ef05ce16_a0d8eb5a",
