      "writtenOn": "2021-11-08T05:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "aosp/master should probably use TetheringNext too, otherwise we\u0027re not testing the latest tethering features and target SDK in AOSP, that makes development/testing a bit harder.\nAlso there\u0027s some continuous testing that is setup in master against stable (Q/R/S) builds, so you\u0027ll need to have a target available in master that can be used for that - it can\u0027t be TetheringGoogleNext as it targets newer SDKs.\nConsidering that I think you\u0027ll need to have both targets ? It would avoid some merge conflicts as well.",
