      "message": "I see, I don\u0027t aware we have the master module build for stable(Q/R/S) builds continuous testing (Before you point out this, I though they all download from *-mainline-prod branch).\n\nIf so, the layout would be\n\nAOSP: com.android.tethering.apex include TetheringNext\n\nBoth *-mainline-prod and master would have:\n1. com.google.android.tethering.apex include TetheringGoogle(will have follow up change for this).\n2. com.google.android.tethering.next.apex include TetheringGoogleNext(will have follow up change for this).\nAnd *-mainline-prod default use com.google.android.tethering.apex, master default use com.google.android.tethering.next.apex. In continuous testing for master build, it could build com.google.android.tethering.apex which contain stable Tethering(TetheringGoogle).",
